Skejja phase-1 Raspberry Pi benchmark kit.

Models in models/ are derived from knowledgator/gliclass-multilang-edge (Apache License 2.0,
https://huggingface.co/knowledgator/gliclass-multilang-edge), Copyright Knowledgator.
Modifications by the Skejja project: vocabulary trimmed to 32,768 tokens (en/it/es/de/fr),
fine-tuning on MASSIVE train utterances (49 intents), an 8-layer student distilled from the
fine-tuned model, ONNX export, weight-only and dynamic int8 quantization.
models/gliclass-edge-w8e4a4 is the unmodified-weights baseline, quantized to ONNX.

Test data in data/ is derived from MASSIVE (Amazon, CC BY 4.0,
https://github.com/alexa/massive), via mteb/amazon_massive_intent; option descriptions
and yes/no questions were added by the Skejja project.
